#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.1.rst:83
msgid ""
"Only WiFi scripts are affected: port WINC code to the standard "
":class:`network.WLAN` interface and fix the NINA ``ifconfig()`` argument "
"order (:ref:`the WiFi API change <v4_1_1_wifi>`). All other scripts run "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Pogođene su samo WiFi skripte: prenesite WINC kod na standardno "
":class:`network.WLAN` sučelje i ispravite redoslijed argumenata NINA "
"``ifconfig()`` (\\ :ref:`promjena WiFi API-ja <v4_1_1_wifi>`\\ ). Sve ostale"
" skripte rade nepromijenjeno."
